Stage07 Demo02: raw caps negotiation
input_caps                     : video/x-raw,format=NV12
output_caps                    : video/x-raw,format=I420
resolution                     : 320x240
command                        : gst-launch-1.0 -q videotestsrc num-buffers=8 ! video/x-raw,format=NV12,width=320,height=240,framerate=30/1 ! videoconvert ! video/x-raw,format=I420 ! fakesink sync=false
exit_code                      : 0
elapsed_ms                     : 140
output_begin
output_end

[walkthrough]
videotestsrc produces raw test frames; first capsfilter requests the producer shape.
videoconvert is the transform element that can change pixel layout.
second capsfilter requests the downstream shape; fakesink consumes buffers without display.

[driver shadow]
On a V4L2-backed hardware element, the same negotiation pressure becomes TRY_FMT/S_FMT and queue buffer layout.
If caps cannot be linked, check plugin pad template first, then driver-supported formats.
verdict=PASS_CAPS_NEGOTIATION
